    figure is computed. Purification prints no P.P.E. (the catalog spell is
    20, which would make 120). Stone to Flesh prints 3; the catalog spell is
    30, which would make 130. All stored as printed and flagged here.
  - SKILLS: base = catalog base + printed bonus. Climb -> Climbing; Identify
    Plants & Fruits -> Identify Plants & Fruit; Basic Mathematics ->
    Mathematics: Basic; Lore: Monsters & Demons -> Lore: Demons & Monsters.
    Native tongue as Language: Native Tongue 98 (no literacy printed). Euro
    +20 -> Language: Euro 70. One additional language +20 -> a Language:
    Other pick. Land Navigation stored at the jungle figure (+20).
  - RELATED: the book calls them other skills: four, plus two at level 2 and
