    Pilot "horsemanship, water vessels and hover vehicles only": the boat,
    water scooter and hover rows plus Horsemanship: General (judgement).
    Rogue "except computer" -> Computer Hacking; Technical "except computers
    and photography" -> Computer Operation, Computer Programming,
    Photography. SECONDARY: two at level one only.
  - The book grants the shaman its own full skill list and says nothing about
    taking an O.C.C., so no occ_restrictions is stored.
  - EQUIPMENT: "the same as the jungle scout". No class is named jungle scout;
